WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,210 --> 00:00:01,730
Are they still eating grass roots?

2
00:00:01,730 --> 00:00:05,780
You have already started selling lobsters, Fang Han

3
00:00:05,780 --> 00:00:08,500
I have one hundred units of wood, how about twenty shrimps?

4
00:00:08,500 --> 00:00:10,380
Okay, no problem, Sanyu succeeds

5
00:00:10,380 --> 00:00:12,740
Get wood to become a hundred fat men

6
00:00:12,740 --> 00:00:14,180
Are you not planning to upgrade your cabin?

7
00:00:15,180 --> 00:00:16,300
My stomach is not even full

8
00:00:16,300 --> 00:00:17,380
Also upgraded the cabin?

9
00:00:17,380 --> 00:00:18,620
Give birth to a ghost

10
00:00:18,620 --> 00:00:19,860
Then you don’t change the meat

11
00:00:19,860 --> 00:00:21,100
Why do you want to exchange shrimps with me?

12
00:00:21,780 --> 00:00:22,860
My family is a shrimp farmer

13
00:00:22,860 --> 00:00:24,260
I plan to raise them

14
00:00:24,260 --> 00:00:25,580
As long as I increase the scale of breeding,

15
00:00:25,580 --> 00:00:26,940
You won’t have to worry about food later

16
00:00:26,940 --> 00:00:28,260
You can also exchange it for something

17
00:00:28,260 --> 00:00:29,900
I don't want to have a full meal of chicken

18
00:00:30,340 --> 00:00:31,340
Very good idea

19
00:00:31,340 --> 00:00:32,940
If you have something good in the future, come and exchange it with me.

20
00:00:32,940 --> 00:00:35,100
I am brother Rouduofang here.

21
00:00:35,100 --> 00:00:36,340
I've been waiting for you

22
00:00:36,340 --> 00:00:37,340
Let's change it to some meat.

23
00:00:37,340 --> 00:00:38,300
Got wind

24
00:00:38,300 --> 00:00:40,860
Every day there are some weeds

25
00:00:40,860 --> 00:00:42,640
How many stones have you saved?

26
00:00:42,640 --> 00:00:44,160
I have saved 200 units.

27
00:00:44,160 --> 00:00:45,880
I've been out moving rocks every day for the past two days.
